      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_acf00f1f0795c930",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p016",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "紹 first receives Xuan’s confession and then kills him in anger."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_15e4a4d2afc5a919",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p024",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "宣計 is Yao Xuan’s plan endorsed by Fosheng."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_6c4b9826605848c4",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p001",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "The intended grants are the ruler’s. In s0048–49 Hong answers Zan and identifies himself as Yuanzi."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_5e9cc859db16525a",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p001",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "叛泓 identifies the ruler the households rebel against. Cao Hong in the same unit is 弘, not 泓."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_1719ea7277cf4130",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p030",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "The actor who relocated the households is 征東姚懿, Yao Yi."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_e2bacec42ed50f00",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p047",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "軍次橫水 continues the march of the army commanded by Yao Shao, who pursues Bobo as 紹 in s0074."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_cb2833e8b76e7c29",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p065",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 receives the surrender at Qiqiu and is the 王鎮惡 named in s0080."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_3fc0f63133c776b6",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p063",
      "kind": "title-reference",
      "note": "陛下 addresses Hong, the sovereign Yi Heng is speaking to; Majesty is part of the address Your Majesty."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_f9842158ba0ab894",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p086",
      "kind": "title-reference",
      "note": "殿下 is the person being remonstrated with, Yao Yi (懿), the emperor’s younger brother."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_f33339402087fde0",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p089",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "Hong implements the preceding advice and dispatches the troops, 於是遣. The Chinese does not repeat the ruler’s name."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_0c7e4972c1a61f91",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p101",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "奔之 continues the account of Yao Hui’s revolt in s0146. Jiang Ji goes over to Hui."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_2dacf9ddc5bcdc27",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p109",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "建威姚娥都 identifies the general among those who surrendered to Hui."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_05efc087f219fe0a",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p123",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "The ruler dispatching Shao at 於是遣 is Hong, the Later Qin ruler in this block."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_f931e8c68a3bc226",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p143",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "After 姚和都討薛帛於河東, Hedu hears that Nan is being intercepted and undertakes the relief march."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_57e01d387ef9f5ec",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p143",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "未至而難敗 contrasts the impending arrival of the reliever Hedu with Nan’s defeat."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_83de07e2cabfbce3",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p143",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "The same commander who marched to Nan’s relief defeats a subordinate of Liu Yu at the river bend; Chen’s assignment was to guard Yaoliu."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_524072874827a8c1",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p160",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "難軍 is the army commanded by Yao Nan in this local block."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_2b63c745d3589aec",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p161",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 is the commander whose forces overtake Yao Nan; the full name appears in s0222."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_303292b7f4c05f01",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p161",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 is the Jin commander whom Qiang and Nan take up positions to resist."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_3cd7a9ee26a225d6",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p161",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 sends Mao Dezu to attack Qiang."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_cf373e018b675f9a",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p167",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "This Qiang is the commander 姚彊 introduced in s0230; his force is routed here."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_e3b0adb19a3ad2b5",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p167",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "彊戰死 says the same commander Yao Qiang died fighting."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_ba867eb5a9d9e09b",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p161",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 advances along the Wei and defeats Yao Pi."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_881430d715e40986",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p161",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "鎮惡 is the commander who enters through Pingshuo Gate."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "jinshu:119:cand_96362c876cf21f22",
      "person": "jinshu:119:p159",
      "kind": "personal-name",
      "note": "贊軍 refers to Yao Zan’s army, which could not enter."
    }
  ]
}
